title: The first start asks before installing the extensions the app comes with, naming each one's exact version, and "Not now" installs none and does not ask again
folders: rust-small
defaults: offered
expect-log: script: Answer\("Not now"\)
forbid-log: getting the ones the app comes with
expect-file: ../data/extensions/defaults.json :: anthropic\.claude-code
expect-file: ../data/extensions/defaults.json :: esbenp\.prettier-vscode
expect-file: ../data/extensions/defaults.json :: dbaeumer\.vscode-eslint
expect-file: ../data/extensions/defaults.json :: miguelsolorio\.symbols
again-forbid-log: getting the ones the app comes with

wait 2500
mark asked
wait 600
answer Not now
wait 1500
mark after
wait 600
quit

=== again
wait 3000
mark again
wait 600
quit
